                        "review": "I praise the creators for their bold attempt, a lot of work went into this indie game. I'll dabble around some more, to satisfy my curiosity, but expect little of adventuring here.\n\nFor mere $.99 I saw Crytek engine in action and how far the hardware has advanced since the days of Crisis... if you are curious same as I was, the 99 cents may be well worth it. Expect little, and a smile or two may be your reward...\n\nOne hour update: this game has potential but needs to be finished. I made $.99 investment that may deliver one day. I'd gladly invest $9.99 to have it finished... :)",
